_panel.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/question_copy_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1vd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1vd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Core copy contract and creation-time validation[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]copy-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy-contract: add the strict and tolerant `copy` normalizers, wire [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]types, and PyO3 bindings to sase-core, then route `sase questions` and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]question-gate creation through them in sase while read paths stay [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tolerant.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generalize the Copy as palette[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]palette-foundation[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]palette-foundation: extend CopyAsModal and CopyAsContext with custom [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sections, title, footer, marker gutter, aligned label column, badges, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]initial highlight, and an opt-in verbatim preview pane, leaving every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing palette pixel-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Question copy panel behind y[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]copy-panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after copy-contract, palette-foundation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy-panel: rebind `y` in UserQuestionModal to open a QuestionCopyModal [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with SNIPPETS and QUESTION sections, stable keys, ordered exact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]delivery, copied checkmarks, a `yy` copy-all path that adds Copyable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]items, and tests, goldens, and TUI docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Discoverability cues on the question pane[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pane-cues[dim] · [dim][/dim]after copy-panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane-cues: show copy progress on the question pane border, underline [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]declared snippets in the prose, and list declared items missing from the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prose in a muted \"also copyable\" block so no copiable value is hidden.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Conservative found-in-text detection[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]found-in-text[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane-cues[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]found-in-text: add a pure sase-core detector for fenced code, filtered [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]backtick spans, scheme URLs, and SASE artifact refs, and render its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]results as a dim FOUND IN TEXT section in the copy panel.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Telegram copy buttons[/bold #D7AFFF]                                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]telegram-copy[dim] · [dim][/dim]after copy-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]telegram-copy: render declared snippets on live Telegram question [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]messages as CopyTextButton rows, and list long or out-of-prose values in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the message text so Telegram shows every declared value.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agent guidance, contract docs, and skill rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]agent-gu